    {
      "title": "五、SOME/IP 详解",
      "icon": "🔗",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "通信模型：从信号到服务"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "CAN时代：                         SOME/IP时代：\n┌─────┐  (门状态=1, 广播)     ┌─────┐  OfferService(门状态服务)\n│ BCM │ ───────→ 所有人       │ BCM │ ───────→ SOME/IP-SD广播\n└─────┘                       └─────┘           ↓\n                              ┌─────┐    Subscribe(我关心门状态)\n                              │ IVI │ ←─────────────┤\n                              └─────┘               ↓\n                              BCM → IVI: Event(门开了)\n                              IVI → BCM: Method(锁门请求)"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "四种通信模式"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "模式",
            "方向",
            "示例"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "**Event**",
              "Server→订阅的Client",
              "车速变化时主动推"
            ],
            [
              "**Method** (R&R)",
              "Client→Server→Client",
              "请求锁门→返回结果"
            ],
            [
              "**Method** (Fire&Forget)",
              "Client→Server",
              "设置氛围灯颜色，无需回复"
            ],
            [
              "**Field** (Get/Set/Notify)",
              "双向",
              "空调温度：可读/可写/变化时通知"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "SOME/IP-TP：大包分段传输"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "style": "标准",
          "text": "SOME/IP基于UDP，单包MTU≈1400字节。ADAS摄像头一帧>1MB怎么办？→ TP分段。"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "原始数据 [█████████████████████████]  1.2MB 单帧\n\n分段后：\nSegment 1: [TP Header | offset=0     | 1392 bytes]\nSegment 2: [TP Header | offset=1392  | 1392 bytes]\n...\nSegment N: [TP Header | offset=...   | 剩余 + MoreFlag=0]\n\nTP Header 关键字段：\n- Message ID (Session ID, 4B)\n- Offset (当前偏移量, 4B)\n- More Segments Flag (1=还有, 0=最后一段)\n- 单段最大 1392 字节 (1400 UDP - SOME/IP Header)"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "vs DoIP",
            "SOME/IP-TP",
            "DoIP"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "传输层",
              "UDP",
              "TCP"
            ],
            [
              "分片",
              "应用层自分段",
              "TCP流自动分段"
            ],
            [
              "适用",
              "实时大数据（摄像头流）",
              "可靠传输（诊断/刷写）"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Service Discovery (SD) 流程"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "Server 启动 → OfferService          \"我提供车速服务！\"\n                                    (广播：Service ID + Instance ID)\n  \nClient 启动 → FindService           \"谁有车速服务？\"\n              (也可等Offer主动来)\n\nClient → SubscribeEventGroup        \"车速变化时通知我\"\nServer → SubscribeACK                \"好的，开始推送\"\nServer → Event(车速=80km/h)         周期性推送"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "阶段性回顾"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "style": "标准",
          "text": "你现在掌握的是：SOME/IP四种通信模式——Event(推送)、Method R&R(请求响应)、Method FF(即发即忘)、Field(读写+通知)。SD流程：OfferService -> FindService -> Subscribe -> SubscribeACK -> Event推送。SOME/IP-TP大包分段(1400字节/段)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "style": "标准",
          "text": "接下来要解决的：SOME/IP解决了服务发现和通信。但远程诊断和刷写怎么办？CAN诊断500Kbps刷写30分钟，以太网100Mbps可以做到3分钟。DoIP就是把UDS诊断搬到以太网上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        }
      ],
      "has_compare": true,
