        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "Step 1: BMCA — 选出主时钟(Grandmaster)\n  所有节点发 Announce → 比较 clockQuality/priority →\n  最优者成为 GM，其余为 Slave\n\nStep 2: Pdelay — 链路延迟测量\n  Slave ──Pdelay_Req─────────→ Master (t1)\n  Slave ←──Pdelay_Resp──────── Master (t2)\n  Slave ←──Pdelay_Resp_FollowUp Master (携带t2, t3)\n  Slave 记录 t4 = 接收时刻\n  → 链路延迟 = ((t4-t1) - (t3-t2)) / 2\n\nStep 3: Sync — 时钟同步\n  Master ──Sync(t1)──────────→ Slave (记录t2)\n  Master ──Follow_Up(t1)──────→ Slave\n  → Clock_Offset = t2 - t1 - 链路延迟\n  → Slave 调整本地时钟 → 全网同步至 <1μs"
